    {
      "id": "95bec8d0-f95d-4886-a09c-9913e2c5d415",
      "name": "Section - Approval and Delivery",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        480,
        832
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 4300,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## 2. Approval and delivery\n\nSensitive final escalations are held for a finance decision using Gmail's **send-and-wait approval** pattern.\n\n- The workflow records the request in `Approval Queue` and updates the invoice's pending state.\n- **Approved:** record the decision, send the final customer escalation, then log the sent outcome.\n- **Rejected or not approved:** record the decision and do not send the customer email.\n- Pending and decided invoices are excluded from future automatic escalation scans. Clear `Approval_Status` manually only when an intentional re-review is required.\n\nConfigure the finance approver and test recipients before activation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
