    {
      "id": "c64ad2ec-87ee-49ba-8833-2cf2c49134bd",
      "name": "Section - Reporting and Error Handling",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        1328
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1450,
        "height": 850,
        "content": "## 3. Reporting and error handling\n\n**Daily summary:** The weekday 6PM schedule reads `Reminder Audit Log` and `Approval Queue`. It counts email outcomes recorded today, current pending approvals, and failures, then emails finance.\n\n**Failure path:** n8n's Error Trigger formats the failed execution details, writes the failure to `Reminder Audit Log`, and alerts finance. This makes operational issues visible without retrying a potentially duplicate customer email.\n\nVerify the n8n instance timezone before activation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
